  "description": "Ji-Hyeok, a troll who posts hate comments online from the comfort of his own room, targeting the popular idol Seon-U. Believing that his miserable life is Seon-U’s fault, Ji-Hyeok had been spewing hateful comments, but eventually, he ends up reuniting with Seon-U at the police station.\n\n*“I’ll give you money—just have sex with me.”*\n\nSeon-U offers to have sex with him in exchange for a large settlement. Ji-Hyeok, who still has feelings for Seon-U, ends up accepting the offer...\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
